WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.917
Watch and read: Ama asks: Read: “First Ama found a lost pencil. Next Ama asked for

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:10.205
help. Finally Ama returned the pencil to the teacher.” What happened finally?

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.656
The answer is: returned the pencil to the teacher. Look for the last event when

00:00:15.656 --> 00:00:16.580
retelling in order.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.701
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which sentence supports this paragraph topic: “Our garden

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:23.509
is beautiful.”?

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:29.537
The answer is: We grow green vegetables.. All sentences in a paragraph should develop

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:30.276
one idea.
